{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12948","headline":"庚子岁避地至玉山詶韩司马所赠 · 独孤及","name":"庚子岁避地至玉山詶韩司马所赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沧海疾风起，洪波骇恬鳞。\n已无济川分，甘作乘桴人。\n挥手谢秣陵，举帆指瓯闽。\n安和风尘表，偶与琼瑶亲。\n共悲行路难，况逢江南春。\n故园忽如梦，返复知何辰。\n旷野豺虎满，深山兰蕙新。\n枉君灞陵什，廻首徒酸辛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12948.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12948","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}